        "id": 1081399
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-07T18:23:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is is meaningful for Wifi to assign chip IDs? Or would it make sense for the WifiChip class to manage those? E.g.\n\n  class WifiChip() {\n    private:\n      static ChipId next_id_;\n  }\n\n  WifiChip::WifiChip(...) {\n    chip_id_ \u003d next_id_++;\n  }",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 40,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "1373f43e9bdf499fb5abea3fda74d098c8a9be14",
