        "id": 1081399
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-07T18:23:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general, I think it\u0027s preferred to pass smart pointer by value, rather than by reference. See, e.g., the example in the style guide [1], and a more explicit rationale on Stack Overflow [2].\n\nIs there any particular reason to prefer passing by reference here?\n\n[1] https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html\n[2] http://stackoverflow.com/a/8385581",
      "range": {
